Placeholders
────────────────────────────────────────

A remote image is never fetched:

[image: Remote]
https://example.com/logo.png — URL
images are never fetched

A path that escapes the collection:

[image: Escape] ../../README.md.png —
outside the collection

A missing file:

[image: Missing] img/nope.png — file
not found

An unsupported format:

[image: Notes] img/notes.txt —
unsupported image format


Inline
────────────────────────────────────────

An image inside a sentence [image:
inline icon] stays inline text.

• [image: In a list]

│ [image: In a quote]
slot line=16 20x4 small.png
slot line=24 40x5 wide.png
slot line=32 40x5 photo.jpg
slot line=42 16x30 tall.png
slot line=76 10x2 diagram.svg
